				<div class='Ctitle'><nobr>경애하는</nobr> <nobr><span style="font-size:110%;font-weight:bold;">김정은</span>동지</nobr>께서 새해 2026년에 즈음하여 금수산태양궁전을 찾으시였다				<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20260101im_/http://www.vok.rep.kp/index.php/revo_de/photoview/ikn260101022/ko "  >
				   				 </a>
